                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The United Nations Security Council met on August 22 from 3 to 6:50 p. m.; for
                    the record, see U.N. document S/PV. 489. No substantive action took place, the
                    entire meeting being devoted to a lengthy statement by the Soviet Representative
                    accusing the United States of aggression in Korea, to which responses were made
                    by the representatives of the United Kingdom and the United States. The Council
                    then adjourned until August 25.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
